This is an extended version of Lander that has a
larger landscape and keyboard support.

It should work on all versions of RISC OS.

To fly using the mouse, just play as normal.

To fly using the keyboard, either press "K" while
on the launchpad and use the following keys:

S       Pitch down
X       Pull up
<       Rotate anti-clockwise
>       Rotate clockwise
A       Fire
Space   Thrust
?       Hover

Or press "L" while on the launchpad and use the
following keys:

"           Pitch down
?           Pull up
Z           Rotate anti-clockwise
X           Rotate clockwise
Return      Fire
Space       Thrust
Left Shift  Hover

Press "Y" while on the launchpad to invert the
y-axis for keyboard controls, which will swap the
keys for pitching down and pulling up.

Press "U" while on the launchpad to set the
y-axis controls back to normal.

Press "J" while on the launchpad to switch back
to the mouse.

Pressing an option key while on the launchpad
will produce a beep, so you know the change has
been registered.

See lander.bbcelite.com for details.

